# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
tools/**/bin/
tools/**/obj/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Decode / staging scratch (never committed)
decode-out/
decode-out-*/
staging/
staging-*/
work/

# Cooked game/mod binary assets — third-party + game-derived IP; NOT redistributed here.
# We track the human-readable analysis (JSON value maps / docs); not the cooked packs.
*.pak
*.ucas
*.utoc
*.sig
*.uasset
*.uexp
*.ubulk
*.usmap
scriptobjects.bin
oodle-data-shared.dll

# Third-party binaries (UE4SS, signature-bypass dll, etc.)
*.dll

# Source archives & third-party tool (not tracked)
*.7z
*.zip
tools/retoc/

# EXCEPTION: the built fix package under dist/ IS tracked for this repo — it ships the
# repaired mod (rebased 153 pak). This deliberately overrides the cooked-asset globs above.
!dist/**
